ont-family: 함초롬바탕\">지역 내 전통시장에서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">20</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">만원의 지원금으로 <font color=\"#0900ff\">사업아이템</font></span><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">먹거리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">공예품 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"> 기획부터 수익창출까지의 비즈니스 실전창업과정을 직접 체험할 수 있는&nbsp;창업&nbsp;캠프를 개최하오니 본교재학생 여러분의 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; TABLE-LAYOUT: fixed; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT