agination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1.&nbsp;캠프내용</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"> </span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- 지원받은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">20</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">만원의 재료비를 활용하여 전통시장 내에서&nbsp;수익을 낼 수 있는 창업활동 체험</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">- 사업아이템은 먹거리, 공예품 등 팀별 아이디어를 담아 가공한 제품만 가능</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- 단, 사</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">행성 등의 일체의 불법행위는 제외&nbsp;</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">- 팀 당 재료비 20만원 지원</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">- <strong><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">팀 별 판매수입금 중&nbsp;50%는 지역사회에 환원하고, 50%는 팀원 배분</font></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- 고객 수요조사 및 사업아이템 발굴 (대구 서문시장 탐방)</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- 창업 관련 전문가 초청특강 및 멘토링</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- <font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><strong>금상/은상/동상 시상 (20/15/10만원)</strong></font></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-